    "description": "<p>Crafted by a Fangshi with FIVE DRAGONS PILL (Internal Elixir ✦✦✦✦✦; Project: Demand 5, Duration 5 hours, Goal 12, Limit 6; needs a Dragon Tooth, Dragon Eye and Dragon Tongue and 10,000mag).</p><p><strong>The ingester takes 3 piercing damage to her Head. Then she can manipulate, control, and shape earth, fire, lightning or water within 20m that she can see. This cannot be larger than a waterfall nor a large 5 meter wide and 20 meter tall pillar. If used to attack, it deals [crafter's INTERNAL ELIXIR] piercing damage along with any other additional environmental effect.</strong></p><p>0.5 kg</p>",
